[[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237882\">1076A46</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237866\">1076B70</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237706\">1080B40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237615\">1084B30</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237872\">1084C38</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the connector (1a) and remove the engine oil cartridge filter\nmounting (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069582.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Refit the engine oil cartridge filter mounting (1a) in its seating\nand secure it with the connector (1b) to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Connector</p></td><td><p>OIL FILTER MOUNT</p></td><td><p>M20</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.6</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069583.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237872\">1084C38</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237615\">1084B30</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237706\">1080B40</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237866\">1076B70</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237882\">1076A46</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the engine oil lubrication system \n\n                                          <strong>- 0010T11 engine oil check level and top up</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]